          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A gentle, coherent friendship story with vivid handling details, though the failed launch ends quietly and the central change is modest.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The ribbon adds a sensible wind-reading step, but the kite still only hops and the ending remains a restrained return rather than a strong payoff.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"June's control over the release supports her confidence arc, but the repeated caution and unsuccessful flight make the resolution somewhat subdued.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"June's blue star and chosen timing lead to a successful second flight, giving the confidence story a clear, concrete and satisfying finish.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A clear sequence of first attempt, patient adjustment, and successful second launch ends effectively with the turning blue kite.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The snag in the hawthorn creates a concrete problem resolved through careful cooperation, although the final choice not to relaunch keeps the payoff mild.\",\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The weather ribbon gives June useful agency, but its insight does not materially alter the unsuccessful outcome, making the plot feel repetitive.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Polished and grammatically sound, but the careful preparations culminate only in a hop and a near-identical quiet ending.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Nia respectfully lets June set the release, a fitting emotional turn, yet the plot concludes without a stronger consequence or achievement.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The acknowledged weak frame and changing wind justify the gentle attempt, but the story largely repeats the unsuccessful-flight resolution.\",\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":3,\"ending\":3,\"language\":3,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All ten stories share Nia inviting shy new girl June to fly a borrowed kite, choosing a quiet patch, responding carefully to wind, and returning the reel. Most—s000029, s000057, s000047, s000068, s000096, s000005, and s000085—end after a failed or minimal flight and a careful return. s000034 and s000073 add a successful second launch, while s000043 resolves a hawthorn snag; these are material but limited branches within one dominant template.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"Nia and June make a cautious kite attempt that fails or barely lifts; they prioritize June's comfort and safely return the borrowed reel.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"After an initial limited flight, the girls use patient coordination for a successful second launch and return the kite and reel.\"},{\"group_id\":2,\"summary\":\"A gust snags the kite in a hawthorn; the girls carefully free it, then choose to stop and return the borrowed reel.\"}]}"
        }
